(7228197, 1117293, 96751, '<td valign="top">Excellent concept, although I feel certain details and the pp''g are slightly off. I love the mixing of the soft folds with the hard lines, but the off-center composition, and crop don''t work for me. I also find the lighting overall a bit flat. Her face, at least, needs a LITTLE more pop, as do her eyes</td>', 'Excellent concept, although I feel certain details and the pp''g are slightly off. I love the mixing of the soft folds with the hard lines, but the off-center composition, and crop don''t work for me. I also find the lighting overall a bit flat. Her face, at least, needs a LITTLE more pop, as do her eyes', '2014-06-13 03:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7228198, 1117402, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is very cool, but it reminds me of another artist whose name I just can''t remember.</td>', 'This is very cool, but it reminds me of another artist whose name I just can''t remember.', '2014-06-13 03:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
