(7230989, 1116830, 62249, '<td valign="top">Someone else also saw this place and entered an image of the door. Interested to find out where this house is.</td>', 'Someone else also saw this place and entered an image of the door. Interested to find out where this house is.', '2014-06-19 15:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7230990, 1116921, 62249, '<td valign="top">Very cool! Love the repetition in the droplets and the softening of the usually very straight Mondrian art.</td>', 'Very cool! Love the repetition in the droplets and the softening of the usually very straight Mondrian art.', '2014-06-19 15:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7230993, 1116335, 62249, '<td valign="top">While this image does have some obvious geometric shapes, it''s not especially reminiscent of Mondrian. Also might benefit from a bit more contrast. Looks kinda flat.</td>', 'While this image does have some obvious geometric shapes, it''s not especially reminiscent of Mondrian. Also might benefit from a bit more contrast. Looks kinda flat.', '2014-06-19 16:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7230995, 1117257, 62249, '<td valign="top">Funny.</td>', 'Funny.', '2014-06-19 16:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7230999, 1117357, 62249, '<td valign="top">Looks more like a nice illustration than a photo.</td>', 'Looks more like a nice illustration than a photo.', '2014-06-19 16:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7231030, 1117420, 176157, '<td valign="top">I didn''t know of Piet Mondrian until I read this challenge. So, I read up on him. So your pic is like, from what I read, a combination of his early paintings and then adding the abstract touch to it from after WW1.  I think its clever.  (I took an art class for the last 3 credits of my bachelour degree - I figured it was am "easy 3 credits."  Big mistake! But it was very interesting).<br/>tmm</td>', 'I didn''t know of Piet Mondrian until I read this challenge. So, I read up on him. So your pic is like, from what I read, a combination of his early paintings and then adding the abstract touch to it from after WW1.  I think its clever.  (I took an art class for the last 3 credits of my bachelour degree - I figured it was am "easy 3 credits."  Big mistake! But it was very interesting).tmm', '2014-06-19 19:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7231031, 1117421, 176157, '<td valign="top">Initial look - looks like teeth or corn kernels.  I like how you didn''t do a pic of what Piet Mondarian is best known for, and elected this idea:  He started out with trees and then his trees became more abstract. (I had to do some research to learn that:  //www.artgenius.co.uk/facts%20about%20piet%20mondrian,%20piet%20mondrian%20trees.html<br/>Its interesting.  tmm</td>', 'Initial look - looks like teeth or corn kernels.  I like how you didn''t do a pic of what Piet Mondarian is best known for, and elected this idea:  He started out with trees and then his trees became more abstract. (I had to do some research to learn that:  //www.artgenius.co.uk/facts%20about%20piet%20mondrian,%20piet%20mondrian%20trees.htmlIts interesting.  tmm', '2014-06-19 19:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7231032, 1117423, 176157, '<td valign="top">I think you met the objective with this pic reflecting Piet Mondrian''s early work.  If you told me this was a real painting, I would believe it.</td>', 'I think you met the objective with this pic reflecting Piet Mondrian''s early work.  If you told me this was a real painting, I would believe it.', '2014-06-19 19:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7231033, 1116491, 176157, '<td valign="top">Is that a photo of a real house? That''s clever.</td>', 'Is that a photo of a real house? That''s clever.', '2014-06-19 19:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7231034, 1117146, 176157, '<td valign="top">all around clever.  you have art (this challenge was about an artist), geometric shapes, rectangles of color, and I believe one can say some abstract elements here.  tmm</td>', 'all around clever.  you have art (this challenge was about an artist), geometric shapes, rectangles of color, and I believe one can say some abstract elements here.  tmm', '2014-06-19 19:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7231035, 1117385, 176157, '<td valign="top">It is an somewhat abstract and has some of the grid based aspects that Piet Mondrian was known for.</td>', 'It is an somewhat abstract and has some of the grid based aspects that Piet Mondrian was known for.', '2014-06-19 20:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7231036, 1117286, 176157, '<td valign="top">It does reflect the grid-based abstracts and rectangles of color (colour) Piet Mondrain is famous for.</td>', 'It does reflect the grid-based abstracts and rectangles of color (colour) Piet Mondrain is famous for.', '2014-06-19 20:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7231048, 1117414, 100831, '<td valign="top">Not too shabby, IMO. The robe takes on a personality of it''s own.</td>', 'Not too shabby, IMO. The robe takes on a personality of it''s own.', '2014-06-19 20:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7231052, 1117185, 100831, '<td valign="top">I''m not generally a fan of wine glass images but this one really works for the challenge, probably because it distorts the norm.  Excellent job on incorporating the reflections.</td>', 'I''m not generally a fan of wine glass images but this one really works for the challenge, probably because it distorts the norm.  Excellent job on incorporating the reflections.', '2014-06-19 20:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7231053, 1117381, 100831, '<td valign="top">Great balls of fire.  Nice find.</td>', 'Great balls of fire.  Nice find.', '2014-06-19 21:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7231058, 1117364, 176157, '<td valign="top">Pretty clever pic. You got it all:  landscape, geometric shapes, grid-based, and rectangles of color. I thinkMondrain would approve.</td>', 'Pretty clever pic. You got it all:  landscape, geometric shapes, grid-based, and rectangles of color. I thinkMondrain would approve.', '2014-06-19 21:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7231060, 1117255, 176157, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  It does reflect the grid-based abstracts and rectangles of color (colour) Piet Mondrian is famous for.</td>', 'Interesting.  It does reflect the grid-based abstracts and rectangles of color (colour) Piet Mondrian is famous for.', '2014-06-19 21:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7231063, 1117401, 176157, '<td valign="top">Are those windows with a sky reflection? And possible some abstract quality in the clouds.</td>', 'Are those windows with a sky reflection? And possible some abstract quality in the clouds.', '2014-06-19 21:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7231065, 1117333, 176157, '<td valign="top">It does reflect the grid-based abstracts and rectangles of color (colour) Piet Mondrian is famous for.  I like the abstract aspect of what I believe were shadows on the verticle columns.</td>', 'It does reflect the grid-based abstracts and rectangles of color (colour) Piet Mondrian is famous for.  I like the abstract aspect of what I believe were shadows on the verticle columns.', '2014-06-19 21:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7231067, 1117416, 176157, '<td valign="top">It reflects the grid-based abstracts and rectangles of color (colour) Piet Mondrian is famous for. I like what you did to the barricades and the abstract-ish shapes in the windows</td>', 'It reflects the grid-based abstracts and rectangles of color (colour) Piet Mondrian is famous for. I like what you did to the barricades and the abstract-ish shapes in the windows', '2014-06-19 21:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7231068, 1116548, 176157, '<td valign="top">It does reflect the grid-based abstracts and rectangles of color (colour) Piet Mondrian is famous for. And how you incorporated some geometric shapes. Your work in the glass is interesting too.</td>', 'It does reflect the grid-based abstracts and rectangles of color (colour) Piet Mondrian is famous for. And how you incorporated some geometric shapes. Your work in the glass is interesting too.', '2014-06-19 21:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7231070, 1117293, 176157, '<td valign="top">I see a lot of work went into this.  Very clever and unique. The eyes even add well to the picture. Its very nice - like a picture one would see National Geographic magazine!</td>', 'I see a lot of work went into this.  Very clever and unique. The eyes even add well to the picture. Its very nice - like a picture one would see National Geographic magazine!', '2014-06-19 21:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7231071, 1116958, 176157, '<td valign="top">wow!even though there is no color, its a very interesting composition.  The shadow or dark spot on the right is ghostly. A little eerie too. You have grid-based content and abstract shapes which Piet Mondrian is known for.</td>', 'wow!even though there is no color, its a very interesting composition.  The shadow or dark spot on the right is ghostly. A little eerie too. You have grid-based content and abstract shapes which Piet Mondrian is known for.', '2014-06-19 21:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7231072, 1117232, 176157, '<td valign="top">Edible art!  If they candy like this in the 1800s, I''m sure Mondrian would have done something similar as a child. I believe you captured the intent of the competition here very well.</td>', 'Edible art!  If they candy like this in the 1800s, I''m sure Mondrian would have done something similar as a child. I believe you captured the intent of the competition here very well.', '2014-06-19 21:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7231073, 1116767, 176157, '<td valign="top">It does reflect the grid-based abstracts, geometry, and rectangles of color (colour) Piet Mondrian is famous for.</td>', 'It does reflect the grid-based abstracts, geometry, and rectangles of color (colour) Piet Mondrian is famous for.', '2014-06-19 21:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7231074, 1116942, 176157, '<td valign="top">Honestly, Its a nice photo; however, I don''t see it reflecting the concepts of Mondrian from what I''ve learned about him.  But I''m not an expert, and I could be very wrong.  The colors are very unique however.  Very beautiful colors.</td>', 'Honestly, Its a nice photo; however, I don''t see it reflecting the concepts of Mondrian from what I''ve learned about him.  But I''m not an expert, and I could be very wrong.  The colors are very unique however.  Very beautiful colors.', '2014-06-19 21:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7231075, 1116713, 176157, '<td valign="top">I believe a lot of detailed work went into this.  Is that the Sydney Opera House?</td>', 'I believe a lot of detailed work went into this.  Is that the Sydney Opera House?', '2014-06-19 21:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7231077, 1117381, 176157, '<td valign="top">Nice title and representation of the challenge.</td>', 'Nice title and representation of the challenge.', '2014-06-19 21:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7231079, 1117203, 176157, '<td valign="top">I like the old window and the grid-based abstracts and rectangles of color  Piet Mondrian is famous for.  And You included trees which, from what I read, he started out painting.</td>', 'I like the old window and the grid-based abstracts and rectangles of color  Piet Mondrian is famous for.  And You included trees which, from what I read, he started out painting.', '2014-06-19 21:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7231080, 1117257, 176157, '<td valign="top">Unique use of clothes and a somewhat abstract look at travel.</td>', 'Unique use of clothes and a somewhat abstract look at travel.', '2014-06-19 21:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7231081, 1117185, 176157, '<td valign="top">From a photography perspective, its a pretty neat picture. And you''ve included the attributes of Mondrians''s work too.</td>', 'From a photography perspective, its a pretty neat picture. And you''ve included the attributes of Mondrians''s work too.', '2014-06-19 21:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7231086, 1117350, 176157, '<td valign="top">I like this photo.  I never heard of Mondrian before.  (I did take an art class in college, but didn''t remember this name.)  After researching Mondrian, I learned he started out painting landscapes and trees before he became interested in abstract.  I believe he would have complimented you on this photo.  It''s nice.</td>', 'I like this photo.  I never heard of Mondrian before.  (I did take an art class in college, but didn''t remember this name.)  After researching Mondrian, I learned he started out painting landscapes and trees before he became interested in abstract.  I believe he would have complimented you on this photo.  It''s nice.', '2014-06-19 21:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7231088, 1117195, 176157, '<td valign="top">Wow.  This is like a Mondrian biography in a picture.  I never heard of him, but enjoyed researching his work.  He started out painting landscapes with fields and windmills.  You also reflect his interest in geometric shapes,  grid-based shapes, and abstracts.</td>', 'Wow.  This is like a Mondrian biography in a picture.  I never heard of him, but enjoyed researching his work.  He started out painting landscapes with fields and windmills.  You also reflect his interest in geometric shapes,  grid-based shapes, and abstracts.', '2014-06-19 22:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7231091, 1116332, 176157, '<td valign="top">It takes some getting used to.  But it is clever and reflects the grid-based work and rectangles of color Piet Mondrian is known for.  In addition, there are geometric shapes and some abstract qualities.</td>', 'It takes some getting used to.  But it is clever and reflects the grid-based work and rectangles of color Piet Mondrian is known for.  In addition, there are geometric shapes and some abstract qualities.', '2014-06-19 22:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7231093, 1117295, 176157, '<td valign="top">This is a unique and clever idea and photo.  I think Mondriam would approve if he were around today.  I like the technical aspects of the photo too (how you combined the in-focus and out of focus together), and realized I have a lot to learn.</td>', 'This is a unique and clever idea and photo.  I think Mondriam would approve if he were around today.  I like the technical aspects of the photo too (how you combined the in-focus and out of focus together), and realized I have a lot to learn.', '2014-06-19 22:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7231095, 1116921, 68504, '<td valign="top">your refactoring is delightful.</td>', 'your refactoring is delightful.', '2014-06-19 22:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7231096, 1117329, 68504, '<td valign="top">dolce.</td>', 'dolce.', '2014-06-19 22:26:50.000000', NULL, 1);
